# The presenter view (spec 26, `s`): the slide as the audience sees it, what comes next, the notes.
# (Scripts have no second window: the view takes the main window's place; the clock stays at 0:00.)
size 1000 640
open speaker.md
keys f5
keys s
shot first.png
keys right
shot second-step.png
keys right
shot middle.png
keys end
shot last.png
keys s
shot back.png
